{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO MIXCITY SWAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/c76d9db3f4c0f71c50e248e1111dbcde.avif?t=1772461856\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras_big/c76d9db3f4c0f71c50e248e1111dbcde.avif?t=1772461856 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight other players in <strong>MIXCITY SWAP</strong>, a fast-paced online <strong>free-to-play</strong> card game that\u2019s easy to learn but full of strategy. Here, all sports mix together \u2014 <strong>from football to p\u00e9tanque, e-sports, even chess</strong>. Because sports and games are meant to bring people together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal? To make a game that\u2019s <strong>competitive, fun, and easy to play</strong>, just like our studio's style: <strong>smart, strategic, and always full of surprises</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/82fa0c57e1d3a2ac2d9c23de6e64c6e6.avif?t=1772461856\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras_big/82fa0c57e1d3a2ac2d9c23de6e64c6e6.avif?t=1772461856 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first player to get <strong>5 KOs</strong> wins the match \u2014 so be smart!<br>Games last <strong>less than 10 minutes</strong>, perfect to play fast, chain matches, and test your decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/7242c703f1f6a54810944f9af772b1fe.avif?t=1772461856\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras_big/7242c703f1f6a54810944f9af772b1fe.avif?t=1772461856 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>MIXCITY SWAP</strong>, there\u2019s <strong>no drawing cards</strong> \u2014 you can play any card from the start.<br>That means <strong>no luck</strong>, just smart plays and real skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like aggressive moves? Or control? Or maybe playing slow and safe?<br><strong>Build the deck</strong> that matches your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/9cf708f90433edc761ead5949bd37c5b.avif?t=1772461856\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras_big/9cf708f90433edc761ead5949bd37c5b.avif?t=1772461856 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main mechanic is called <strong>\u201cSWAP\u201d</strong> \u2014 it lets you <strong>switch a card from your hand with one already on the field</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use it to <strong>save a card</strong> that\u2019s about to get KO\u2019d.<br>But it can also <strong>trigger effects</strong> like <strong>buffs</strong>, damage, healing, or even an instant KO\u2026<br>It all depends on your cards and your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to <strong>think about your placements, protect key cards, predict your opponent\u2019s plays, and create big combos</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move matters. Every SWAP can change the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/df954794db273caa50e64183d651c91e.avif?t=1772461856\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras_big/df954794db273caa50e64183d651c91e.avif?t=1772461856 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIXCITY</strong> is a <strong>futuristic city</strong> where all sports are celebrated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A table tennis player can fight a boxer. A rugby player teams up with a high-tech para-athlete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most of all, it\u2019s <strong>an inclusive city</strong> \u2014 fun, kind, and full of life, where people and sports are the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to join the Playtest sessions? Click the \u201cRequest Access\u201d button!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you want to follow the game\u2019s development, <strong>join us on Discord!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562250?t=1772461856","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/9d44dfebe69071e2abbd1c115d3471edbedb1e40/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772461856","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/8006d35c2e7ce81fd7cf24da7bcee1062706c048/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772461856","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/8006d35c2e7ce81fd7cf24da7bcee1062706c048/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772461856","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO MIXCITY SWAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/c76d9db3f4c0f71c50e248e1111dbcde.avif?t=1772461856\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras_big/c76d9db3f4c0f71c50e248e1111dbcde.avif?t=1772461856 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight other players in <strong>MIXCITY SWAP</strong>, a fast-paced online <strong>free-to-play</strong> card game that\u2019s easy to learn but full of strategy. Here, all sports mix together \u2014 <strong>from football to p\u00e9tanque, e-sports, even chess</strong>. Because sports and games are meant to bring people together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal? To make a game that\u2019s <strong>competitive, fun, and easy to play</strong>, just like our studio's style: <strong>smart, strategic, and always full of surprises</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/82fa0c57e1d3a2ac2d9c23de6e64c6e6.avif?t=1772461856\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras_big/82fa0c57e1d3a2ac2d9c23de6e64c6e6.avif?t=1772461856 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first player to get <strong>5 KOs</strong> wins the match \u2014 so be smart!<br>Games last <strong>less than 10 minutes</strong>, perfect to play fast, chain matches, and test your decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/7242c703f1f6a54810944f9af772b1fe.avif?t=1772461856\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras_big/7242c703f1f6a54810944f9af772b1fe.avif?t=1772461856 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>MIXCITY SWAP</strong>, there\u2019s <strong>no drawing cards</strong> \u2014 you can play any card from the start.<br>That means <strong>no luck</strong>, just smart plays and real skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like aggressive moves? Or control? Or maybe playing slow and safe?<br><strong>Build the deck</strong> that matches your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/9cf708f90433edc761ead5949bd37c5b.avif?t=1772461856\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras_big/9cf708f90433edc761ead5949bd37c5b.avif?t=1772461856 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main mechanic is called <strong>\u201cSWAP\u201d</strong> \u2014 it lets you <strong>switch a card from your hand with one already on the field</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use it to <strong>save a card</strong> that\u2019s about to get KO\u2019d.<br>But it can also <strong>trigger effects</strong> like <strong>buffs</strong>, damage, healing, or even an instant KO\u2026<br>It all depends on your cards and your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to <strong>think about your placements, protect key cards, predict your opponent\u2019s plays, and create big combos</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move matters. Every SWAP can change the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras/df954794db273caa50e64183d651c91e.avif?t=1772461856\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/extras_big/df954794db273caa50e64183d651c91e.avif?t=1772461856 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIXCITY</strong> is a <strong>futuristic city</strong> where all sports are celebrated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A table tennis player can fight a boxer. A rugby player teams up with a high-tech para-athlete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most of all, it\u2019s <strong>an inclusive city</strong> \u2014 fun, kind, and full of life, where people and sports are the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to join the Playtest sessions? Click the \u201cRequest Access\u201d button!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you want to follow the game\u2019s development, <strong>join us on Discord!</strong></p>","developers":["ATYPIQUE studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/08c886cb58f159f783e6cb447454fe72eef72c94/header.jpg?t=1772461856","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3562250/772974691/87732273c83fb296881a489326cd7ee5cf3d7f32/1750860038/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749135950","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3562250/772974691/87732273c83fb296881a489326cd7ee5cf3d7f32/1750860038/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749135950","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3562250/772974691/87732273c83fb296881a489326cd7ee5cf3d7f32/1750860038/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749135950","id":257151699,"name":"Mixcity Swap  - Trailer Alpha","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151699/83c56b140f25ca02ab62bb20256e88d514c3b0b7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749135950"}],"name":"MIXCITY SWAP","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i3-14100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 650 / Radeon 4800 HS<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i5-12400 / Ryzen 5 5500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 970 / Radeon 6500<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["ATYPIQUE studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/787b05afa3e8f9178d4f1c4217f00dad3a497839/ss_787b05afa3e8f9178d4f1c4217f00dad3a497839.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772461856","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562250/787b05afa3e8f9178d4f1c4217f00dad3a497839/ss_787b05afa3e8f9178d4f1c4